ata-start=\"759\" data-end=\"1126\" align=\"justify\">The <strong data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"789\">Intel OT-ST727 I350-T2</strong> is a high-performance <strong data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"858\">dual-port Gigabit Ethernet network adapter</strong> designed for reliable server and workstation connectivity. Based on the powerful <strong data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"965\">Intel I350-T2 chipset</strong>, it offers robust performance with full support for <strong data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1037\">10/100/1000Mbps</strong> speeds over <strong data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1068\">two RJ45 ports</strong>, ensuring seamless network throughput and load balancing.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1364\" align=\"justify\">Built with a <strong data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1173\">PCI Express 2.1 x4 interface</strong>, the adapter delivers enhanced I/O efficiency, low latency, and low power consumption — making it an ideal solution for virtualization, data center deployments, or enterprise-grade networks.</p><h3 data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1394\"><strong data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1394\">Key Features:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1996\"><li data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1442\">\n<p data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1442\"><strong data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1407\">Model:</strong> Intel OT-ST727 (I350-T2 chipset)</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1507\">\n<p data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1507\"><strong data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1459\">Interface:</strong> PCI Express x4 (compatible with x8/x16 slots)</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1547\">\n<p data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1547\"><strong data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1520\">Ports:</strong> Dual RJ45 Ethernet Ports</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1596\">\n<p data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1596\"><strong data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1560\">Speed:</strong> 10/100/1000 Mbps auto-negotiation</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1627\">\n<p data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1627\"><strong data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1611\">Chipset:</strong> Intel I350-T2</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1675\">\n<p data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1675\"><strong data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1650\">IEEE Compliance:</strong> 802.3, 802.3u, 802.3ab</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1877\">\n<p data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1693\"><strong data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1691\">Features:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1877\"><li data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1719\">\n<p data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1719\">Jumbo Frame support</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1738\">\n<p data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1738\">VLAN tagging</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1757\">\n<p data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1757\">PXE Boot ROM</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1775\">\n<p data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1775\">Wake-on-LAN</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"1815\">\n<p data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1815\">Load balancing &amp; failover support</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1877\">\n<p data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1877\">Intel Virtualization Technology for Connectivity (VT-c)</p>\n</li></ul>\n</li><li data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1946\">\n<p data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1946\"><strong data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1909\">Operating System Support:</strong> Windows Server, Linux, VMware ESXi</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1996\">\n<p data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1996\"><strong data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1996\">Low-profile &amp; full-height brackets included</strong></p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2025\"><strong data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2023\">Ideal For:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2162\"><li data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2059\">\n<p data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2059\">Servers and rackmount systems</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2088\">\n<p data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2088\">Virtualized environments</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2129\">\n<p data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2129\">Enterprise desktops and workstations</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2162\">\n<p data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2162\">Network-attached storage (NAS)</p></li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Mellanox CX4121A-ACAT CX4 10G/25G SFP28 Ethernet Network Card","href":"/mellanox-cx4121a-acat-cx4-10g25g-sfp28-ethernet-network-card","now":"18,000৳","old":"20,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Silicom 4x 10GE Quad Port PCI Express 3.0 SFP+ Network Adapter","href":"/%20silicom-4x-10ge-quad-port-pci-express-30-sfp-network-adapter","now":"18,000৳","old":"20,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Intel OT-ST7218 PCIe x8 X710-DA2 Dual 10GbE SFP+ PCIe 3.0 Network Adapter","href":"/intel-ot-st7218-pcie-x8-x710-da2-dual-10gbe-sfp-pcie-30-network-adapter","now":"18,000৳","old":"18,500৳","single":""},{"name":"IBM Broadcom BCM957800A 4-Port 2x10Gb SFP+ 2x1GbE RJ45 PCI Express 2.0 x8 Low-Profile Ethernet Network Adapter","href":"/ibm-broadcom-bcm957800a-4-port-2x10gb-sfp-2x1gbe-rj45-pci-express-20-x8-low-profile-ethernet-network-adapter","now":"9,000৳","old":"9,500৳","single":""},{"name":"IBM Broadcom BCM957800A 4-Port 2x10Gb SFP+ 2x1GbE RJ45 PCI Express 2.0 x8 High-Profile Ethernet Network Adapter","href":"/ibm-broadcom-bcm957800a-4-port-2x10gb-sfp-2x1gbe-rj45-pci-express-20-x8-high-profile-ethernet-network-adapter","now":"9,500৳","old":"10,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Supermicro 2xRJ45 10GbE Ports AOC-STG-i2T Rev. 2.01 PCIe x8 Intel X540 Ethernet Network Adapter","href":"/%20supermicro-2xrj45-10gbe-ports-aoc-stg-i2t-rev-201-pcie-x8-intel-x540-ethernet-network-adapter","now":"7,500৳","old":"9,000৳","single":""},{"name":"IBM Intel X710-DA2 Dual Port 10GB SFP+ 01DA902 PCI Express x8 3.0 Ethernet Network Adapter","h